SpRobo is the launcher; the included simulation framework is simple_rbt.
SpRobo 是启动器；随包提供的仿真框架仍为 simple_rbt。

This application package is assembled from the user's prepared local checkout.
No package-wide license is asserted by the packaging process.

Bundled runtime libraries:
  MuJoCo: Apache-2.0; licenses/mujoco/ also records third-party notices.
  Classic drawing adaptation: Apache-2.0; licenses/mujoco_classic/ records source hashes and local changes.
  ONNX Runtime: MIT; licenses/onnxruntime/ includes third-party notices.
  NVIDIA CUDA runtime: governed by licenses/cuda/EULA.txt.
  meshoptimizer: MIT; licenses/meshoptimizer/ records the pinned source.
  nlohmann/json headers: MIT; licenses/nlohmann/LICENSE.MIT.
  Native Go console modules: licenses/console/ contains upstream notices.
  Franka Emika Panda model: Apache-2.0; licenses/panda/LICENSE.
  Skydio X2 model: Apache-2.0; assets/visual/skydio_x2/LICENSE and provenance.json.
  RL SAR code/policy provenance: licenses/rl_sar-go2/ and rl_sar-go2w/.
  Legacy MuJoCo-LiDAR provenance: licenses/MuJoCo-LiDAR/.

The existing asset provenance is preserved in
/usr/share/simple-rbt/assets/manifests/, assets/visual/ and assets/lidar/source.json.
Ranger Mini and Scout Mini preserve upstream package.xml BSD declarations;
Clearpath Ridgeback preserves its upstream BSD-3-Clause LICENSE.
FR-mini package.xml declares TODO and no upstream root LICENSE is present.
In particular, the pinned rl_sar_zoo Go2/Go2W meshes and the MID360 scan CSV
have no explicit redistribution license established in this checkout.
This local package does not establish permission to publicly redistribute them.
The application checkout itself has no root LICENSE file.

